{
  "file_id": "3520",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 209,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "During the summer of that year,\nstrange events happened all over\nEarth.",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 1,
      "_offset": 24776,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "Durante el verano de ese año,\nsucedieron cosas extrañas en\nla Tierra."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "The rice fields in southeast Asia\ndried up from drought, while heavy\nrains flooded the Middle East...",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 1,
      "_offset": 24848,
      "_bytes": 101,
      "translation": "Los arrozales del sudeste de\nAsia sufrían sequías, y las\nlluvias asolaban Oriente Medio."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "And the coldest summer on record\nhit America.",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 1,
      "_offset": 24950,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "América registró su verano\nmás frío."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Little did seven children at\nsummer camp know...",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 1,
      "_offset": 24996,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "Siete chicos, de campamento,\nno sabían que..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "that this was only the beginning\nof an adventure in an unknown\nworld...",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 1,
      "_offset": 25045,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "este era sólo el comienzo\nde una aventura en un mundo\ndesconocido..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25117,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "What's up, Sora?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25125,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¿Qué pasa, Sora?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Now's not the time to be sleeping.\nHelp me pitch this tent.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25142,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "No es momento de dormir.\nAyúdame a montar la tienda."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Ugh...Fine...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25202,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "Ugh...Vale..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "...Brr!!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25216,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "...¡¡Brr!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "What's up?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25225,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¿Qué pasa?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Something's falling from the\nsky... Is that...snow?!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25236,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Algo cae del cielo...\n¡¿Es... nieve?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Don't be silly! How could it snow\nin the middle of summe--\nWhoa, that's cold!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25289,
      "_bytes": 77,
      "translation": "¡No digas bobadas! Cómo va a\nnevar en pleno vera--\n¡Guau! ¡Qué frío!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "See, I was right! It's snowing...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25367,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¿Ves? ¡Te lo dije! Está nevando..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "You're right...it's snowing hard!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25401,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Tienes razón... y nieva fuerte!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25435,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Izzy! Why's it snowing in the\nmiddle of summer?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25443,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Izzy, ¿por qué nieva en medio\ndel verano?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "It may be another case of the\nabnormal weather we've been\nhaving.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25496,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "Será otro caso más del\ntiempo loco que hace\núltimamente."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "We'll have to wait it out...\nOh, I know!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25562,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "Esperemos a que se pase...\n¡Ah, ya sé!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "What?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25603,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¿Qué?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "I saw a small shrine while we were\non the way here. We can take\nshelter there.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25609,
      "_bytes": 78,
      "translation": "Vi un santuario mientras\nveníamos hacia aquí. Podríamos\nrefugiarnos allí."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Sounds good! Izzy, let's go\ntell the others.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25688,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Suena bien! Izzy, vamos\na avisar al resto."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "All right!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25738,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Vale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "That was a huge blizzard...\nBut it looks like it's finally\nstopped.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25749,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "Menuda ventisca...\nParece que por fin ha\namainado."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Yay! Hey, Matt, look! It's white\nall over!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25817,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡Yuju! ¡Hey, Matt, mira!\n¡Está todo blanco!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Why's it snowing in summer? Is it\nfrom all that abnormal weather\nlately?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25862,
      "_bytes": 72,
      "translation": "¿Por qué nieva en verano?\n¿Es por el clima loco de\núltimamente?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "This is our campsite?! It looks\ntotally different!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25935,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¡¿Este es el campamento?!\n¡No parece ni el mismo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Mimi! Don't run around, you'll\nslip and fall!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25986,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "¡Mimi! ¡No corras, que\nte vas a caer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Ah...Ah...Achoo! The weather\nforecast didn't say it was going\nto snow, didn't it?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26032,
      "_bytes": 81,
      "translation": "Ah...Ah...¡Achús! La predicción\nno dijo nada de que iba a\nnevar, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "I would suggest advising everyone\nnot to stray too far from this\nplace.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26114,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "Recomendaría a todos no marcharse\nlejos de este lugar."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "It's not working, I can't get \nonline... I thought I'd connect \nonce the winds stopped...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26186,
      "_bytes": 89,
      "translation": "No funciona... No puedo acceder a\nInternet. Pensé que podría tras\nel temporal..."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Jeez, T.K...As soon as I take\nmy eyes off him, he's gone off\nsomewhere.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 26276,
      "_bytes": 74,
      "translation": "Pf... T.K... Le quitas el ojo\nde encima un segundo y\ndesaparece."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Brrr, it's cold...Hard to believe\nit's still summer!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26351,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Brrr, qué frío. ¡Cuesta creer que\naún sea verano!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Tai! We should get back to the\nadults. They'll be worried about\nus.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26404,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "¡Tai! Deberíamos volver.\nEstarán preocupados por nosotros."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Wow! It's so pretty! The fresh\nsnow looks like it's sparkling!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26475,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "Guau... ¡Qué bonito! ¡La nieve\nfresca parece como si brillase!"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Yay! Snow! There's so much snow!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26538,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Yuju! ¡Nieve! ¡Hay mucha nieve!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "What's that? Whoa!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26571,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¿Qué es eso? ¡Guau!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "What a beautiful aurora! It's so\nromantic!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26590,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "¡Qué aurora más bonita! ¡Es tan\nromántico!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "I've never seen one before!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26633,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡Nunca la había visto antes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "But that's strange! It makes no\nsense for an aurora to be in\nJapan!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26661,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "¡Qué raro! ¡No tiene ningún sentido\nver la aurora boreal en Japón!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "It makes no sense for an aurora to\nbe in Japan!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 26729,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "¡No tiene sentido que la aurora se\nvea en Japón!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Tai! You're up! Thank goodness!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26777,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡Tai! ¡Estás aquí! ¡Menos mal!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "It talked! It knows my name! What\nthe heck are you?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26812,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "¡Ha hablado! ¡Sabe mi nombre! ¡¿Qué\nleches eres tú?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I'm Koromon! I've been waiting for\nyou, Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26865,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "¡Soy Koromon! ¡Te he estado\nesperando, Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Koromon...? Waiting for me?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26913,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¿Koromon...? ¿Esperándome?"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26941,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "What's that supposed to mean? And\nhow do you even know my name?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 26947,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "¿Qué se supone que significa eso?\n¿Y cómo es que sabes mi nombre?"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27012,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Oh! Izzy!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27020,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Oh! ¡Izzy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Thank goodness. I thought I was\nall alone here...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27035,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "Gracias al cielo. \nPensé que estaba solo aquí..."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "So did I! Since you're here in one\npiece, that must mean the others\nare okay, too!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27085,
      "_bytes": 82,
      "translation": "¡Y yo! ¡Pero si estás bien,\neso quiere decir que los\ndemás también están bien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "But I'm here with you, y'know.",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27168,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "Pero... estoy aquí, ya sabes."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Aaaagh! Izzy, what's that?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27199,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Aaagh! Izzy, ¡¿qué es eso?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "I'm Mochimon. Nice to meet ya!",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27232,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¡Soy Motimon! ¡Un placer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "He's been following me around ever\nsince I woke up here. I don't know\nwhat's going on.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27263,
      "_bytes": 86,
      "translation": "Me ha estado siguiendo desde que\nme desperté aquí... No sé qué\nestá pasando."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Here?...Where are we?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27350,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¿Aquí? ¿Dónde estamos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "We here're on File Island!",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27372,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Estamos en la Isla File!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "File Island...?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27399,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "Isla... ¿File?"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "That's right! File Island!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27415,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Eso es! ¡Isla File!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "That's what they're saying, but...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27442,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "Eso es lo que dicen, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Hmm... Let's take a good look\nat this place.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27477,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Hmm... Echemos un vistazo a este\nlugar..."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Hey, maybe I'll be able to see\nmore from the top of that tree.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27522,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "Hey, quizás pueda ver algo desde\nlo alto de ese árbol."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Go for it, Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27585,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Buena idea, Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Just a bit further...I'm\nalmost...there...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27604,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "Sólo un poco más... Ya... Casi..."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "There...we go!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27647,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "Y... ¡estoy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Do you see anything, Tai?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27662,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¿Ves algo, Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Hmm...Ah, there's an ocean over\nthere! But I don't remember seeing\nthose mountains...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27691,
      "_bytes": 85,
      "translation": "Hmm...¡Ah, hay un océano ahí!\nPero... no recuerdo haber visto\nesas montañas..."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Hey, Tai! Can I climb up too?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27777,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Hey, Tai! ¿Puedo subir también?"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Huh? Uh...W-What's that?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27810,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¿Eh? Eh... ¡¿Q-Qué es eso?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Kryaaaahhh!",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27836,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Kryaaahhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Huh? A giant stag beetle?! And\nit's coming this way!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27848,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¿Un escarabajo gigante?\n¡Y viene hacia aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Oww...It pushed me out of the\ntree! What the heck was that?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27901,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "Au... ¡Me ha tirado del árbol!\n¡¿Qué leches era eso?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Oh no! That's Kuwagamon! A real\nterrible Digimon!",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 27962,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Oh no! ¡Es Kuwagamon! ¡Un Digimon\nterrible!"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "He's coming this way, Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28012,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¡Viene hacia aquí, Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Hey, what are you doing?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28042,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "Eh, ¡¿qué estás haciendo?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Poof!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28068,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Puf!"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Kryaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 4902,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28074,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Kryaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Bubbles...?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28084,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¿Burbujas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Tai! We have to go, now!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28096,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡Tai! ¡Tenemos que irnos ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Got it! Come on, Izzy!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28124,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡De acuerdo! ¡Vamos Izzy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28152,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Vale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Izzy, this way!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28158,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "Izzy, ¡por aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "O-Okay!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28179,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡V-Vale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "No matter what we do, it's gonna\nkeep chasing us! We've gotta find\nsomewhere to hide...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28187,
      "_bytes": 87,
      "translation": "¡Da igual lo que hagamos, nos va a\nperseguir! Tenemos que encontrar\nun escondrijo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Here! This-a-way!",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28275,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Aquí! ¡Por aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Will he be able to find us here?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28293,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¿Podrá encontrarnos aquí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Shh! It'll be fine.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28326,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Sh! Estaremos bien."
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28346,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28350,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28354,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "It's okay, he's gone now!",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28358,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Está bien, se ha ido!"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Ah!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28384,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "¡Ah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Is anyone there?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28388,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¿Hay alguien ahí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Sora! You're okay!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28405,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Sora! ¡Estás bien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "That was a close one...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28424,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "Ha estado cerca..."
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Matt! You're here, too!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28448,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Matt! ¡Estás tú también!"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Tai! So you guys are here, too.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28474,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡Tai! Estabais aquí también."
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Wahhhhhhhh! Guys!!",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28509,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡¡Waaahhh!! ¡¡Chicos!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Joe!...I have no idea what's going\non...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28528,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¡Joe!... No tengo ni idea de qué\npasa..."
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "But I'm glad everyone's okay!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28569,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¡Me alegro de que estéis bien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Matt! What's that thing you're\nholding?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28599,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Matt! ¿Qué es eso que tienes\nen la mano?"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Oh, this guy?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28641,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "Oh, ¿éste?"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "I'm Tsunomon...",
      "speaker_id": 2211,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28655,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "Soy Tsunomon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Why is your face all red?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28671,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¿Por qué se ruboriza?"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "He gets embarrassed easily.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28697,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Parece muy tímido..."
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 2211,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28725,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "So they all have different\npersonalities, huh?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28729,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Así que tienen personalidades\ndiferentes, ¿eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Tai, this weird thing is\nchasing me!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28776,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "Tai, ¡esta cosa extraña me\npersigue!"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "I'm not a weird thing! I'm\nPukamon!",
      "speaker_id": 2611,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28816,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡No soy una cosa!\n¡Soy Pukamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Ngaaahhhh! What is this thing?!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28852,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Ngaaaahh! ¡¿Qué es esta cosa?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "I'm not a \"thing\", okay? I'm\nPukamon!",
      "speaker_id": 2611,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28884,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "No soy una \"cosa\", ¿vale? ¡Soy\nPukamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Seems like you two are already\ngetting in some quality bonding\ntime!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28922,
      "_bytes": 68,
      "translation": "Parece que ambos estáis ya\ndándoos a conocer bastante\nbien, ¿eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "It's been chasing me this whole\ntime, so I'm all burnt out.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 28991,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "¡Me ha perseguido durante todo\neste tiempo! ¡Qué pesadez!"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Hey, Sora! Your thing looks like a\nplant.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29051,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Ey, Sora! El tuyo parece una\nplanta."
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Haha! She's called Yokomon.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29093,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Jaja! Se llama Yokomon."
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "I'm Yokomon!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29122,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Soy Yokomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "Hey, Sora, is Yokomon a girl?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29136,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "Eh Sora, ¿Yokomon es... chica?"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "Do they even have gender in the\nfirst place?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29167,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Hmm ¿dirías que tienen género,\npara empezar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "We'll figure it out eventually...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29212,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Lo sabremos con el tiempo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "There are so many species here of\nwhich I've never seen the likes of\nbefore... What is this place?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29246,
      "_bytes": 98,
      "translation": "Hay muchas especies aquí que no\nhabía visto antes...\n¿Dónde se supone que estamos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "There's a lotta stuff I wanna talk\nto him about, but he's totally\nlost in thought.",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29345,
      "_bytes": 82,
      "translation": "Hay un montón de cosas de las que\nquiero hablar con él, pero está\nensimismado."
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "Once he's lost in something, it's\nhard to get his attention.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29428,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "Una vez se le mete algo en mente\nes difícil sacarlo de ahí."
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "There are so many species here of\nwhich I've never seen the likes of\nbefore...What is this place?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29489,
      "_bytes": 97,
      "translation": "Hay muchas especies aquí que no\nhabía visto antes...\n¿Dónde se supone que estamos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "There's a lotta stuff I wanna talk\nto him about, but he's totally\nlost in thought.",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29587,
      "_bytes": 82,
      "translation": "Hay un montón de cosas de las que\nquiero hablar con él, pero está\nensimismado."
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "Once he's lost in something, it's\nhard to get his attention.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29670,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "Una vez se le mete algo en mente\nes difícil sacarlo de ahí."
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "So, who's this?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29731,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¿Quién es este?"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "Wait for me, Tokomon!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29747,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Espérame, Tokomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "Ahaha! I'm over here, T.K!",
      "speaker_id": 2711,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29769,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¡Jaja! ¡Estoy aquí, T.K.!"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "So, what exactly are you guys?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29799,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¿Qué sois exactamente, chicos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "So, what exactly are you guys?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 29830,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¿Qué sois exactamente, chicos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "So, what exactly are you guys?",
      "speaker_id": 2211,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 29861,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¿Qué sois exactamente, chicos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "We're Digital Monsters!",
      "speaker_id": 6061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29892,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡Somos Digimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "Digital...Monsters...?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29916,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¿Digi...mon...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "That's right!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29939,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Eso es!"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "Well, I guess we'll introduce\nourselves. I'm Tai Yagami, a\nfifth grader at Odaiba Elementary.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 29953,
      "_bytes": 96,
      "translation": "Bueno, toca presentarse, supongo.\nSoy Tai Yagami, voy a quinto de\nprimaria en Odaiba."
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "I'm Sora Takenouchi, I'm also\nin fifth grade!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30050,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "Yo soy Sora Takenouchi. ¡También\nde quinto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "I'm also a fifth-grader. Matt\nIshida.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30096,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "Yo también de quinto. \nSoy Matt Ishida."
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "Joe Kido, I'm in sixth grade!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30136,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Joe Kido, ¡yo voy a sexto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "I'm Izzy Izumi, I'm in\nfourth grade.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30166,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "Soy Izzy, y estoy aún\nen cuarto."
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "Uh...And this is...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30208,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Eh... y este es..."
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "I'm T.K Takaishi! I'm in second\ngrade.",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30228,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Soy T.K.! ¡Y ya voy a segundo de\nprimaria!"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "So your name's T.K? Nice to\nmeet you.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30270,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¿Te llamas T.K.?\n¡Un placer conocerte!"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "Yeah! Nice to meet you!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30311,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡Sí! ¡Un placer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Is that all of us?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30335,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¿Estamos todos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "Wait a minute...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30354,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "Un momento..."
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "Mimi from fourth grade is missing!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30371,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡¿Dónde está Mimi?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "Kyaaaaaahhh!",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30406,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Kyaaaahhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "Isn't that Mimi's voice?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30419,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "Es la voz de Mimi, ¡¿no?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "It came from that way!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30444,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¡Viene de ahí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "What's that?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30467,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué es eso?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "english": "Oh, I'll do the explainin'.",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30481,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Oh, ya te explico yo."
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "english": "You can use this to save where\nwe're at right now.",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30509,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "Puedes usar esto para guardar\ndónde estamos ahora."
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "english": "Save?! You're talking as if we're\nin a game.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30560,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡¿Guardar?! Me hablas como si fuese\nun juego."
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "english": "Savin's important, so don't forget\nto save every time ya find one of\nthese.",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30605,
      "_bytes": 75,
      "translation": "Guardar es importante,\nhazlo siempre que te\nencuentres uno de estos."
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "english": "Also, when you go inside one of\nthese, you come out feeling\nenergized!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30681,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "¡Además, si te metes ahí dentro,\nrecuperas toda tu energía!"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "english": "So if we're tired, we should come\nrest here!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30752,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Si estamos cansados,\ndeberíamos venir."
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "english": "So if we're tired, we should come\nrest here!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30797,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Si estamos cansados,\ndeberíamos venir."
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "english": "*sob* Guys...!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30842,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "(snif) ¡Chicos...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "english": "Mimi, are you okay?",
      "speaker_id": 2511,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30857,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Mimi, ¿estás bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "english": "Kryaaaaaagh!!",
      "speaker_id": 4902,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30877,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡¡Kryaagh!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "english": "Okay! Let's fight him off! All\ntogether, now!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 30891,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "¡Vale, toca luchar!\n¡Todos juntos, ahora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "english": "Okay! Let's fight him off! All\ntogether, now!",
      "speaker_id": 2211,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 30937,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "¡Vale, toca luchar!\n¡Todos juntos, ahora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "english": "Okay! Let's fight him off! All\ntogether, now!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 30983,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "¡Vale, toca luchar!\n¡Todos juntos, ahora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 6061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 31029,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "english": "Poof!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 31035,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Puf!"
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "english": "Poof poof poof poof!",
      "speaker_id": 2211,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 31041,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Puf puf puf puf!"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "english": "Poof!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 31062,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Puf!"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "english": "Poof poof poof!",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 31068,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Puf puf puf!"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
